Subject: [PATCH 3/9] =?UTF-8?q?fix(db):=20jogador=20n=C3=A3o=20altera=20o?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20pr=C3=B3prio=20papel=20(DEF-01)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Migração 022 restringe o UPDATE de profiles às colunas display_name e
color. Reteste: supabase/fichas-rls.test.ts passa; regressão: suíte
completa (438 testes) aprovada.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AcqLqFvmo7Uwcr37XkFG3N
---
 supabase/migrations/022_profiles_role_lock.sql | 11 +++++++++++
 supabase/schema.sql                            |  4 ++++
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 supabase/migrations/022_profiles_role_lock.sql

diff --git a/supabase/migrations/022_profiles_role_lock.sql b/supabase/migrations/022_profiles_role_lock.sql
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2d9b3ef
--- /dev/null
+++ b/supabase/migrations/022_profiles_role_lock.sql
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+-- DEF-01 (P2 — Testes e Qualidade): jogador conseguia virar mestre editando
+-- o próprio perfil, porque a política profiles_update_own libera a linha
+-- inteira, inclusive a coluna role.
+-- Correção: o usuário logado só altera as colunas que o app usa.
+-- O papel continua sendo trocado só pelo SQL Editor (README, passo 3).
+-- Rode no SQL Editor do Supabase.
+
+revoke update on public.profiles from anon, authenticated;
+grant update (display_name, color) on public.profiles to authenticated;
+
+notify pgrst, 'reload schema';
diff --git a/supabase/schema.sql b/supabase/schema.sql
index d7bb805..f589b2f 100644
--- a/supabase/schema.sql
+++ b/supabase/schema.sql
@@ -2262,3 +2262,7 @@ create policy "table_reports_delete" on public.table_reports
 
 
 notify pgrst, 'reload schema';
+
+-- ========== 022: papel só muda pelo SQL Editor (DEF-01) ==========
+revoke update on public.profiles from anon, authenticated;
+grant update (display_name, color) on public.profiles to authenticated;
-- 
